{"id": "certified-local-firms-large-affiliates", "title": "Certified small firms tied on record to the City’s largest contractors", "seconds": 153.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "5125c8175b67d12b", "words": 408, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "San Francisco gives certified small local firms a head start on City contracts.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.23, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Certified local firm", "small"], "b": ["Its recorded affiliate", "paid hundreds of millions"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.75, 1.02, 1.54, 1.9, 2.22, 2.62, 2.71, 2.87, 3.13, 3.24, 3.48]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "So what if a small firm’s affiliate is a City giant?", "t0": 4.35, "t1": 7.9, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Certified local firm", "small"], "b": ["Its recorded affiliate", "paid hundreds of millions"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["City giant"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.34, 0.46, 0.56, 1.06, 1.39, 2.09, 2.27, 2.33, 2.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["oneLine", "story[1]", "links[0]", "links[1]"], "text": "The City’s own directory says 166 of its 973 certified firms have restricted affiliates.", "t0": 7.9, "t1": 14.38, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Contract Monitoring Division", "sub": "certifies"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Certified small firms", "sub": "166 with recorded affiliates"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Large affiliates", "sub": "not certified themselves"}], "kicker": "What the directory records"}, "emph": ["166"], "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.5, 0.64, 1.09, 1.4, 1.59, 1.92, 2.59, 2.68, 2.86, 3.13, 3.46, 4.12, 4.61, 5.36, 5.52, 5.94]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat", "story[10]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. The City wrote these ties down itself.", "t0": 14.5, "t1": 19.12, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.32, 0.43, 1.19, 1.4, 1.46, 2.48, 2.68, 2.95, 3.21, 3.42, 3.81, 4.04]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "The first lead. In 19 cases, the affiliate isn’t certified itself.", "t0": 19.34, "t1": 23.79, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["5", "times", "more"], "sub": "and at least $5.0 million, since fiscal 2019"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.95, 1.15, 1.62, 2.41, 2.56, 3.1, 3.43, 3.92]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "And it was paid at least 5 times as much.", "t0": 23.91, "t1": 25.99, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["5", "times", "more"], "sub": "and at least $5.0 million, since fiscal 2019"}, "emph": ["5 times"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.23, 0.41, 0.71, 0.8, 1.07, 1.34, 1.65, 1.77]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[2]"], "text": "The largest affiliate, paid since fiscal 2019?", "t0": 26.11, "t1": 30.12, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Architectural Material Solutions, Inc.", "certified local firm"], "b": ["CLARK CONSTRUCTION GROUP - CALIF LP", "$708.6 million"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.66, 1.15, 1.55, 1.82, 2.24, 2.51]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[2]"], "text": "708.6 million dollars.", "t0": 30.12, "t1": 33.36, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$708.6 million", "label": "paid to the largest affiliate", "sub": "CLARK CONSTRUCTION GROUP - CALIF LP, since fiscal 2019"}, "emph": ["708.6"], "wt": [0.04, 0.57, 1.02, 1.29, 1.6, 2.08, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "The second lead. On 38 contracts, a local-flagged subcontractor worked under its own recorded affiliate.", "t0": 33.98, "t1": 39.67, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A subcontractor under its own affiliate", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "38 pairings, 8 distinct firm pairs"}, "emph": ["38 contracts"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 1.04, 1.22, 1.67, 2.27, 2.42, 3.15, 3.86, 4.16, 4.35, 4.52, 4.85, 5.26]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "amount", "links[3]"], "text": "6.4 million dollars in listed shares.", "t0": 39.79, "t1": 42.53, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6.4 million", "label": "in listed subcontract shares", "sub": "38 contracts since 2013"}, "emph": ["6.4 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.74, 1.07, 1.44, 1.8, 1.91, 2.23]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The most frequent: Esquivel Grading and Paving, with its affiliated trucking firm under it. 22 contracts.", "t0": 42.95, "t1": 49.92, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "ESQUIVEL GRADING & PAVING INC", "sub": "prime contractor"}, {"art": "van", "name": "LAVINA TRUCKING, INC.", "sub": "its recorded affiliate, as subcontractor"}], "kicker": "22 contracts, $5.1 million"}, "emph": ["22 contracts"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.37, 1.13, 1.77, 2.19, 2.32, 3.2, 3.38, 3.48, 3.98, 4.33, 4.56, 4.77, 5.53, 6.28]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "timeline[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "In 2023, Esquivel won a pavement contract inside a 10 percent local-business bid discount.", "t0": 50.04, "t1": 55.8, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Lowest bid, Precision Engineering, Inc.", "$7,141,243"], "b": ["Esquivel, inside a 10% bid discount", "$7,304,499"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.38, 1.35, 1.91, 2.07, 2.14, 2.54, 3.05, 3.49, 3.6, 3.94, 4.44, 5.12, 5.31]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "timeline[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "163,257 dollars above the lowest bid.", "t0": 55.92, "t1": 62.29, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Lowest bid, Precision Engineering, Inc.", "$7,141,243"], "b": ["Esquivel, inside a 10% bid discount", "$7,304,499"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["163,257"], "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.59, 1.36, 2.11, 2.4, 2.81, 3.4, 4.09, 4.46, 4.57, 4.93]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "timeline[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Its affiliate was the subcontractor.", "t0": 62.29, "t1": 64.24, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Lowest bid, Precision Engineering, Inc.", "$7,141,243"], "b": ["Esquivel, inside a 10% bid discount", "$7,304,499"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.73, 0.92, 1.05]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "If that share counts toward a goal, the prime meets it with its own companies.", "t0": 64.36, "t1": 68.11, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the prime is meeting the goal with its own family of companies"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.34, 0.63, 0.96, 1.25, 1.32, 2.0, 2.14, 2.47, 2.71, 2.79, 2.92, 3.07, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "form", "ref": ["story[10]", "established[3]"], "text": "Esquivel is certified itself, so that share may never have been counted.", "t0": 68.23, "t1": 72.05, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "ESQUIVEL GRADING & PAVING INC", "sub": "certified itself", "rows": [["Prime contractor", "certified"], ["Its affiliate’s share", "may never have been counted"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.64, 1.14, 2.07, 2.25, 2.4, 2.7, 2.9, 3.14, 3.26, 3.44]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "amount"], "text": "Of the 6.4 million,", "t0": 72.17, "t1": 74.26, "shot": "b12x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Under a certified prime (Esquivel)", "$5.1 million"], "b": ["Under large uncertified affiliates", "$430,990"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.27, 0.54, 0.83, 1.11]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "amount"], "text": "only 430,990 dollars sits under a", "t0": 74.26, "t1": 79.12, "shot": "b12x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Under a certified prime (Esquivel)", "$5.1 million"], "b": ["Under large uncertified affiliates", "$430,990"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["430,990"], "wt": [0.04, 0.36, 0.67, 1.09, 1.45, 2.29, 2.58, 3.0, 3.36, 4.31, 4.59, 4.8]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "amount"], "text": "large affiliate that isn’t certified.", "t0": 79.12, "t1": 81.29, "shot": "b12x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Under a certified prime (Esquivel)", "$5.1 million"], "b": ["Under large uncertified affiliates", "$430,990"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.04, 0.45, 1.17, 1.38, 1.62]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third lead: ties the directory doesn’t record. 12 pairings with larger firms carry no restriction.", "t0": 81.51, "t1": 87.94, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Shared address or owner-group", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "12 of 14 pairings with no recorded restriction"}, "emph": ["12"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 1.0, 1.39, 1.49, 1.97, 2.29, 3.67, 4.08, 4.46, 4.64, 5.04, 5.45, 5.7, 5.86]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The largest: Urban West Construction, beside Ranger Pipelines.", "t0": 88.06, "t1": 92.51, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Urban West Construction Inc.", "directory firm"], "b": ["Ranger Pipelines Inc.", "$128.7 million"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 1.15, 1.59, 1.95, 2.96, 3.46, 3.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "128.7 million dollars.", "t0": 92.63, "t1": 95.27, "shot": "b14x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$128.7 million", "label": "Ranger Pipelines Inc.", "sub": "beside Urban West Construction Inc."}, "emph": ["128.7 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.62, 1.14, 1.46, 1.81, 2.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "A recorded tie limits credit. An unrecorded one doesn’t.", "t0": 95.39, "t1": 98.28, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Urban West Construction Inc.", "directory firm"], "b": ["Ranger Pipelines Inc.", "$128.7 million"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.8, 1.09, 1.69, 1.85, 2.36, 2.52]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[6]"], "text": "No one person is on both licences. Each shares a principal with a third firm, Landmark Construction.", "t0": 98.4, "t1": 104.66, "shot": "b14L", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Urban West Construction Inc.", "sub": "one licensed principal"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Landmark Construction Inc", "sub": "the third firm"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Ranger Pipelines Inc.", "sub": "another licensed principal"}], "kicker": "The State licence file"}, "emph": ["a third firm"], "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.49, 0.85, 0.97, 1.11, 1.38, 2.52, 2.79, 3.1, 3.18, 3.55, 3.68, 3.76, 4.05, 4.96, 5.57]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "The fourth lead: since 2025, 114 names flagged local aren’t found in the directory.", "t0": 104.88, "t1": 111.01, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "114", "label": "names flagged local, not found in the directory", "sub": "teams starting on or after 2025-01-01"}, "emph": ["114"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 1.32, 1.59, 1.84, 2.88, 3.04, 3.29, 3.82, 4.2, 4.51, 4.84, 5.12, 5.47, 5.56, 5.63]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "The largest: 129.8 million dollars.", "t0": 111.13, "t1": 114.9, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "MITCHELL ENGINEERING", "sub": "the largest local-business share", "chip": "$129.8 million"}, "emph": ["129.8 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 1.3, 1.44, 1.76, 2.32, 2.61, 2.87, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "It may be a spelling difference, or a lapsed certification.", "t0": 115.02, "t1": 117.62, "shot": "b16x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Not found in the directory", "sub": "a spelling difference, or a lapsed certification"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.3, 0.42, 0.51, 0.97, 1.34, 1.46, 1.53, 1.81]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Mitchell Engineering is also recorded as a certified firm’s affiliate,", "t0": 117.74, "t1": 121.42, "shot": "b16m", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "MITCHELL ENGINEERING", "kicker": "In two lists at once", "sub": "a restricted affiliate of Westland Contractors Inc", "chip": "$188,528,447 since fiscal 2019"}, "emph": ["also recorded"], "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.89, 1.04, 1.34, 1.78, 1.93, 2.0, 2.49, 2.83]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "paid 188,528,447 dollars since fiscal 2019.", "t0": 121.42, "t1": 126.34, "shot": "b16m", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "MITCHELL ENGINEERING", "kicker": "In two lists at once", "sub": "a restricted affiliate of Westland Contractors Inc", "chip": "$188,528,447 since fiscal 2019"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.62, 0.95, 1.39, 1.93, 2.18, 2.53, 2.89, 3.54, 3.79, 4.13, 4.38]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "headline", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "The fifth lead: one certified firm is named in the Controller’s debarment reports.", "t0": 126.56, "t1": 130.88, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "headline", "date": "2025-06-30", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "text": "AZUL WORKS INC, on the Controller’s debarment and suspension reports"}, "emph": ["debarment"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 1.23, 1.51, 1.97, 2.28, 2.41, 2.63, 2.7, 2.79, 3.34, 3.76]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Its certification runs to October 2028. The reports don’t say how the matter ended.", "t0": 131.0, "t1": 136.22, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["On the reports", "2020-12-31 to 2025-06-30"], "b": ["Certified until", "2028-10-31"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["October 2028"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.86, 1.17, 1.34, 1.8, 2.1, 3.24, 3.42, 3.88, 4.12, 4.42, 4.57, 4.67, 4.91]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records don’t show any share was credited, or that any firm is ineligible.", "t0": 136.44, "t1": 140.77, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether any affiliate’s share was credited toward a goal", "That any firm is ineligible", "Whether each name match is the same firm: the records do not show"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.56, 0.78, 1.08, 1.43, 1.77, 1.94, 2.8, 2.93, 3.08, 3.28, 3.65, 3.77]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]", "established[10]"], "text": "What would settle it? The primes’ subcontractor payment reports, and the certification files.", "t0": 140.89, "t1": 145.9, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The primes’ subcontractor payment reports"}, {"who": "", "what": "The certification files behind each directory entry"}, {"who": "", "what": "A test of the “pass-through” offers firms described in the City’s 2026 Contracting Equity Study"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.36, 0.69, 1.36, 1.49, 1.81, 2.48, 2.77, 3.53, 3.76, 3.86, 4.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "No authority has made a finding, and none of the firms here were asked to respond.", "t0": 146.02, "t1": 150.02, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.66, 0.79, 0.94, 1.01, 1.84, 2.04, 2.22, 2.28, 2.38, 2.71, 2.93, 3.13, 3.34, 3.43]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 150.14, "t1": 152.24, "shot": "b22", 